me UAV applications require more than one device to accomplish their mission with high accuracy.","reason":""},{"report_id":"R0022","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0022.pdf","status":"OBSERVED","page":1,"section":"I. INTRODUCTION","excerpt":"a central UAV coordinates a group of computing-capable UAVs to collaboratively process DNN inference tasks.","reason":""},{"report_id":"R0029","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0029.pdf","status":"OBSERVED","page":1,"section":"I. INTRODUCTION","excerpt":"partitioning DNN among UAVs, which means dividing the DNN into several subtasks and offloading among UAVs","reason":""},{"report_id":"R0044","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0044.pdf","status":"OBSERVED","page":1,"section":"I. INTRODUCTION","excerpt":"we propose a multi-UAV-assisted framework for DNN collaborative inference and task offloading that ensures communication reliability","reason":""},{"report_id":"R0045","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0045.pdf","status":"OBSERVED","page":1,"section":"I. INTRODUCTION","excerpt":"it is extremely challenging to execute DNN-based tasks directly on resource-constrained mobile devices","reason":""},{"report_id":"R0048","pdf_path":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0048.pdf","status":"OBSERVED","page":1,"section":"I. INTRODUCTION","excerpt":"Collaborative multiple UAVs are highly sensitive to inference latency and energy consumption in video analytics","reason":""}]}
